# Every selftest (a file named *_selftest.patlang) the gates run, each in a
# v2_interp process of its own, and the retired ones, each with its reason. A
# selftest passes when its process exits 0 and its output says "ALL TESTS
# PASSED".
#
# Usage, from the repository root:
#   self_hosting/build/v2_interp.exe self_hosting/tools/run_selftests.patlang [--list | --retired] [SELFTEST...]
#
# With --list, the paths of the selftests it runs, one a line, and nothing run.
# With --retired, the retired selftests' paths and reasons, a tab between. With
# paths, only those selftests run; with none, all of them. Exits with 1 when one
# failed. The gates run each as a unit of its own (selftests/NAME in
# self_hosting/v2/tools/gates.patlang, docs/plans/gates.md), and the repository
# checks fail when a selftest is in neither list.
#
# lean_goap_synthesis_selftest needs `lean` on the PATH, and
# synthesis_by_example_selftest needs `ruby`.

include "../lib/includes.patlang"
include "../lib/gherkin_text.patlang"

